      "solution_steps": [
        "找不动点",
        "证明单调有界",
        "求极限"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "recursive_sequence",
        "template": "$b_{n+1} = \\frac{1}{2}(b_n + c/b_n)$（牛顿迭代法求平方根）",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明收敛并求极限",
          "steps": [
            "**求不动点**：设 $L = \\frac{1}{2}(L + \\frac{2}{L})$，则 $2L = L + \\frac{2}{L}$，$L = \\frac{2}{L}$，$L^2 = 2$，$L = \\sqrt{2}$（取正值）。",
            "**证明下有界**：由 $b_1 = 1 > 0$，且由算术-几何平均不等式，$b_{n+1} = \\frac{1}{2}(b_n + \\frac{2}{b_n}) \\geq \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 2\\sqrt{b_n \\cdot \\frac{2}{b_n}} = \\sqrt{2}$。",
            "所以 $b_n \\geq \\sqrt{2}$ 对 $n \\geq 1$。",
            "**证明单调递减**：$b_{n+1} - b_n = \\frac{1}{2}(b_n + \\frac{2}{b_n}) - b_n = \\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{2}{b_n} - b_n) = \\frac{2 - b_n^2}{2b_n}$。",
            "由于 $b_n \\geq \\sqrt{2}$，有 $b_n^2 \\geq 2$，故 $2 - b_n^2 \\leq 0$，$b_{n+1} - b_n \\leq 0$，数列单调递减。",
            "**应用单调有界定理**：$\\{b_n\\}$ 单调递减且有下界 $\\sqrt{2}$，故收敛。",
            "**求极限**：取极限，$L = \\frac{1}{2}(L + \\frac{2}{L})$，解得 $L = \\sqrt{2}$。",
            "因此 $\\boxed{\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} b_n = \\sqrt{2}}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
