      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "recursive_mean_iteration",
        "template": "$c_{n+1} = \\frac{c_n^2 + k}{2c_n}$ 形式的迭代",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明收敛并求极限",
          "steps": [
            "**求不动点**：$L = \\frac{L^2 + 3}{2L} \\Rightarrow 2L^2 = L^2 + 3 \\Rightarrow L^2 = 3 \\Rightarrow L = \\sqrt{3}$（取正）。",
            "**下有界**：由 AM-GM 不等式，$c_{n+1} = \\frac{c_n^2 + 3}{2c_n} \\geq \\frac{2\\sqrt{c_n^2 \\cdot 3}}{2c_n} = \\frac{2c_n\\sqrt{3}}{2c_n} = \\sqrt{3}$。",
            "故 $c_n \\geq \\sqrt{3}$ 对所有 $n$。",
            "**单调性**：$c_{n+1} - c_n = \\frac{c_n^2 + 3}{2c_n} - c_n = \\frac{c_n^2 + 3 - 2c_n^2}{2c_n} = \\frac{3 - c_n^2}{2c_n}$。",
            "由 $c_n \\geq \\sqrt{3}$，有 $c_n^2 \\geq 3$，故 $3 - c_n^2 \\leq 0$，数列单调递减。",
            "**收敛**：单调递减且有下界，故收敛。",
            "**极限**：$L = \\frac{L^2+3}{2L}$，解得 $L = \\sqrt{3}$。",
            "因此 $\\boxed{\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} c_n = \\sqrt{3}}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
