      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求不动点",
        "做变量替换",
        "求和求极限"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "linear_recurrence_first_order",
        "template": "$d_{n+1} = ad_n + b$，转化为 $e_n = d_n - L$ 的形式",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 1,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "证明收敛并求极限",
          "steps": [
            "**求不动点**：$L = \\frac{L+4}{2} \\Rightarrow 2L = L + 4 \\Rightarrow L = 4$。",
            "**做变换**：令 $e_n = d_n - 4$，则 $e_{n+1} = d_{n+1} - 4 = \\frac{d_n+4}{2} - 4 = \\frac{d_n-4}{2} = \\frac{e_n}{2}$。",
            "故 $e_n = e_1 \\cdot (1/2)^{n-1}$。",
            "$e_1 = d_1 - 4 = 3 - 4 = -1$，所以 $e_n = -\\frac{1}{2^{n-1}}$。",
            "**还原**：$d_n = e_n + 4 = 4 - \\frac{1}{2^{n-1}}$。",
            "**求极限**：$\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} d_n = 4 - \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\frac{1}{2^{n-1}} = 4 - 0 = \\boxed{4}$。"
          ]
        }
      ],
